<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Happy Birthday!</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9a9e, #fad0c4);
            text-align: center;
            color: #fff;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .container {
            margin-top: 100px;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 3em;
        }

        .card {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            width: 80%;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: auto;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        button {
            padding: 12px 25px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 25px;
            background: #ff4d6d;
            color: white;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        #surprise {
            display: none;
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 1.2em;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <h1>🎂 Happy Birthday! 🎉</h1>

            <p>
                Wishing you a day filled with happiness, laughter,
                and everything that makes you smile.
            </p>

            <button onclick="showSurprise()">
                Click for Your Surprise ✨
            </button>

            <div id="surprise">
                <p>
                    Although we've only recently connected,
                    I'm glad our paths crossed.
                </p>

                <p>
                    May your year ahead be full of joy, success,
                    beautiful memories, and endless smiles.
                </p>

                <p><strong>Have a wonderful birthday! 🌸</strong></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function showSurprise() {
            document.getElementById("surprise").style.display = "block";
        }
    </script>

</body>
</html>
